    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draconis 8 is a trading card game with the balance and strategy of a tile-laying board game. Each pack includes a terrain card and a complete, balanced eight-card deck for one player \u2014 featuring one powerful dragon and seven champions ready for battle. With millions of possible stat combinations, every card is individually generated to provide endless possibilities. No two cards are alike, yet all are designed to be fair and balanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, both players draw a card, giving them a two card hand. Then both players choose one of their two cards to play, and reveal them simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the 7 turns of the game, cards will form a 4x4 grid. Once there are 4 cards in a row or column, the edges of the grid on that side are locked and cards can't be played beyond those edges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Draconis 8 app is the perfect companion to the physical game. Using a device with a camera you can scan the code on each of your physical card packs and get an exact copy of that pack in the app. Use your packs in a variety of game formats! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital-only gameplay options are also available.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draconis 8 is a trading card game with the balance and strategy of a tile-laying board game. Each pack includes a terrain card and a complete, balanced eight-card deck for one player \u2014 featuring one powerful dragon and seven champions ready for battle. With millions of possible stat combinations, every card is individually generated to provide endless possibilities. No two cards are alike, yet all are designed to be fair and balanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, both players draw a card, giving them a two card hand. Then both players choose one of their two cards to play, and reveal them simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the 7 turns of the game, cards will form a 4x4 grid. Once there are 4 cards in a row or column, the edges of the grid on that side are locked and cards can't be played beyond those edges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Draconis 8 app is the perfect companion to the physical game. Using a device with a camera you can scan the code on each of your physical card packs and get an exact copy of that pack in the app. Use your packs in a variety of game formats! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital-only gameplay options are also available.</p>",
    "short_description": "Draconis 8 is a card game with no rare cards to chase \u2014 every pack is mathematically balanced. Instead of randomness or rarity, strategy comes from smart deck play. Each pack is a complete eight-card deck, ready for tactical combat inspired by tile-laying board games.",
